window.EN={"1":"Having passed through the so-called \"thieves' forest,\" before the eyes of Leif's \"Liberation Army,\"","2":"the fortress city of Tahra at last revealed itself.","3":"General List, what is the situation?","4":"Sir. The encirclement of Tahra is complete, Commander Paulus.","5":"I am thinking of launching an all-out attack now.","6":"I see... But Baldack's 8th Corps should arrive soon.","7":"Don't force things too hard. There is no need to lose soldiers for nothing.","8":"Sir, I am aware of that.","9":"Hmph. As if I'd let Baldack snatch away my glory.","10":"All troops, we now launch an all-out attack! No retreat is allowed! Attack, attack, and keep on attacking!","11":"So the all-out attack has begun at last... Well, what now, Glade?","12":"The plain fact is the difference in numbers is too great... At this rate, it is only a matter of time before we are wiped out.","13":"Shall I go and throw the enemy into confusion? I think it would buy us some time...","14":"No, that's no good. The enemy has long arches. Go in alone and you'll just be the perfect target.","15":"A dragon knight's basics are to strike by surprise and get out. Eda, impatience is forbidden.","16":"Yes, brother.","17":"For now, I'll send out my knights.","18":"Will your unit alone be enough, Glade? The mercenaries have all run off.","19":"Mm. What about Prince Shannan?","20":"If he is a direct descendant of the Sword Saint Od, his power should be beyond compare with ours.","21":"Why does he refuse to cooperate?","22":"Ah... that man.","23":"...I don't really understand it, but he says he has no interest in the battles of commoners, or some such.","24":"Hmph. And if he then busies himself chasing women, there's no helping him.","25":"...It can't be helped. We'll go by ourselves.","26":"Don't push too hard. It's only just begun. There's still a long way to go.","27":"I know.","28":"Prince, what you see beyond that mountain is the fortress city of Tahra.","29":"...Mm, this is bad.","30":"It seems the Empire's all-out attack has already begun.","31":"We can't leave the people of Tahra to die. Let's break into Tahra at once.","32":"However, only part of our forces has arrived so far.","33":"What's more, the besieging army has many long arches deployed. Is it not somewhat dangerous?","34":"I know the danger, but there is no other way. If we allow Tahra to fall, our fight ends here too.","35":"Isn't that right, August?","36":"Indeed. We would lose the people's support completely.","37":"With our present strength, if we lose even the people's support, all that remains is to vanish.","38":"Glade? ...Is that you, Sir Glade!","39":"? ...Prince Leif!? I-it can't be...","40":"Glade, you seem surprised. This is indeed Prince Leif.","41":"The lord who leads our army of the Kingdom of Leonster, and also the leader of the Liberation Army of northern Thracia.","42":"The army of the Kingdom of Leonster...","43":"Then, Lord Dorias, our long-cherished wish will finally be fulfilled!","44":"That's right, Glade. We are going home to Leonster.","45":"With our own hands we will liberate the people suffering under the Empire's tyranny,","46":"and raise this banner of Gae Bolg once more over the royal castle of Nova!","47":"Ahh... At last, this day...","48":"Lord Leif! Now that King Calf and Prince Quan are gone, you are our only hope.","49":"Please carry on your father's will!","50":"Of course! Glade, let's take back Leonster together.","51":"Yes, sir!","52":"We retainers of Leonster will follow you anywhere, Lord Leif!","53":"Glade, you're safe!","54":"Finn. It's been a long time.","55":"Not since the battle at Ulster. It's been ten years already...","56":"So it has... It was a long time, but you protected Lord Leif well.","57":"I must thank you.","58":"That goes both ways. You helped Lord Dorias and raised the Lanzenritter.","59":"Without that force, Lord Leif could not have come this far.","60":"Back then, we made a promise.","61":"That I would keep protecting the flag of Leonster, and you Prince Leif, even at the cost of our lives.","62":"Yes... And now, at last, it has been fulfilled.","63":"But Glade, the battle has only just begun. We can't afford to relax.","64":"True. Not until the banner of Gae Bolg flies over Leonster again...","65":"Finn, sharing a drink with you comes after that.","66":"For now, take Lord Leif and get inside Tahra castle.","67":"There is also word that a large enemy force is approaching. It's dangerous to stay like this!","68":"Glade, you're safe. Thank goodness...","69":"Selphina... You came too.","70":"Yes. I heard of Tahra's crisis and came with Lord Leif.","71":"But I'm truly glad I could see you...","72":"I'm sorry for making you worry.","73":"But Selphina... I have let many young men die again.","74":"When I think, if only I had more strength, I can't stop regretting it...","75":"No! You are the finest knight in Leonster.","76":"I am proud to be your wife.","77":"So please don't blame yourself so...","78":"Thank you, Selphina. Seeing you has given me strength. Oh, that's right, look at this.","79":"What is this? ...It can't be... the legendary Brave Bow!?","80":"So it seems. I found it by chance in the city of Tahra.","81":"I bought it thinking of you. Will you use it?","82":"Yes, of course! Thank you, dear!","83":"Glade, you're safe. Thank goodness...","84":"Selphina... You came too.","85":"Yes. I heard of Tahra's crisis and came with Lord Leif.","86":"I see. I met the prince a moment ago, and I was surprised at how much he's changed.","87":"Ten years since we parted at Ulster... He's fifteen already...","88":"I was surprised too when I first saw him.","89":"To think he had grown so big.","90":"...He's become a fine young man. It was like looking at Lord Quan in his youth.","91":"I thought he resembled Lady Ethlyn. Around the eyes, he's really just like her.","92":"Is that so? I think those eyes come from Lord Quan...","93":"No, they're Lady Ethlyn's!","94":"She doted on me like a little sister, so I remember well!","95":"Hey, hey, no need to get so worked up.","96":"He's their child. Of course he resembles them.","97":"Oh... you're right, I'm sorry.","98":"I ended up remembering all sorts of things about Lady Ethlyn, and so I just...","99":"Yes... Leaving behind her newborn prince, how much she must have regretted it...","100":"Yes...","101":"In those days... Lady Altena was often jealous of little Lord Leif, and Lady Ethlyn was at a loss.","102":"But she looked truly happy, and I wished that when I grew up I'd be a mother like Lady Ethlyn.","103":"And then, that... nightmarish event in the Yied...","104":"Selphina...?","105":"I'm sorry... I swore I would never cry again...","106":"No, it's all right. More to the point, look at this bow.","107":"What is this...? It can't be... the legendary Brave Bow!?","108":"So it seems.","109":"I found it by chance in the city of Tahra. I bought it thinking of you. Will you use it?","110":"Yes, of course! Thank you, dear!","111":"Hey, I hear you're going to Tahra. A lot of the imperial soldiers are heavily armored. Take this Armorslayer with you.","112":"Welcome. I have heard of your exploits.","113":"I'll give you this Knight Proof. Put it to good use.","114":"My, you're going to Tahra's relief? That takes courage.","115":"But with few weapons, you'd be ill-prepared. Take this hammer with you.","116":"...Lord Leif?","117":"Linoan!! Thank goodness, we've finally met.","118":"Lord Leif!... You truly... came for us...","119":"Ahh, God... I thank you for your will!","120":"...Linoan, I'm sorry. I should have come sooner.","121":"I never imagined Tahra, which raised me, was in such a miserable state.","122":"And all of it, just because I was here... Even your father...","123":"No, that's not so!","124":"My father was prepared from the moment he took you in, Lord Leif.","125":"He had made up his mind that he did not care if he became a sacrificial stone, in order to open up a new world.","126":"I am proud of that father.","127":"My father's death was sad, and the Empire's tyranny was hard,","128":"but believing only that I would see you again, Lord Leif, I have held on until today.","129":"But... because of my shortcomings, the lives of tens of thousands of Tahra's citizens are about to be lost.","130":"I no longer know what I should do...","131":"Linoan, it's all right. You don't need to worry anymore.","132":"I will protect Tahra and you without fail. I swear it on this sword!","133":"Tahra has fallen!","134":"Now that Tahra has been taken by the Empire, the people's hearts will not side with us.","135":"Our fight ends here...","136":"Damn it, how can this be!!","137":"Mmgh... My glory... gah!"};
